option: buildable-host no
---

# platform.geek.sdcard

The GEEK boards' TF socket, wired for four-bit SDIO and used here in SPI mode through
mm.sdcard: SPI0: clock GP18, MOSI GP19 (the card's CMD), MISO GP20 (DAT0), chip select GP23 (DAT3),
from Waveshare's RP2040-GEEK and RP2350-GEEK schematics. rp2040_geek and
rp2350_geek bind it. The panel is on SPI1, so the two never share a bus. The card runs at 25 MHz once identified, which the Pico's
SPI divider rounds down to what it holds.
